## 🎯 Integration Checklist

### Backend
- [x] Tournament schema with phases
- [x] Create tournament endpoint (`POST /tournements`)
- [x] Get all tournaments (`GET /tournements`)
- [x] Register team (`POST /tournements/:id/register-team`)
- [x] Unregister team (`DELETE /tournements/:id/unregister-team/:teamId`)

### Flutter
- [ ] Add `http` package to [pubspec.yaml](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/arena_chain_flutter/pubspec.yaml)
- [ ] Create tournament models (`tournament_model.dart`)
- [ ] Create tournament service (`tournament_service.dart`)
- [ ] Create tournament list screen
- [ ] Create tournament creation screen
- [ ] Create tournament detail screen
- [ ] Integrate with auth service for user ID
- [ ] Test tournament creation flow
- [ ] Test team registration flow

---

## 🚨 Important Notes

1. **User Authentication**: Replace `'user_id_placeholder'` with actual user ID from your auth service
2. **Game IDs**: Update the game list with actual game IDs from your catalog
3. **API URL**: Change `http://localhost:3000` to your actual backend URL
4. **Ranked vs Official**: Add a backend field to distinguish tournament types if needed
5. **Image Upload**: The backend supports banner image upload via multipart/form-data

